{"title":"NYSML Problems and Solutions","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>This is a list of all <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=NYSML\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"NYSML\">NYSML</a> exams in the AoPSWiki.  All are lacking both questions and solutions.  If you find problems which are not in the AoPSWiki, please consider adding them.  Also, if you notice that a problem in the Wiki differs from the original wording, feel free to correct it.  Finally, additions to and improvements on the solutions in the AoPSWiki are always welcome.\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_NYSML&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1973 NYSML (page does not exist)\">1973 NYSML</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_NYSML&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1974 NYSML (page does not exist)\">1974 NYSML</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_NYSML&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1975 NYSML (page does not exist)\">1975 NYSML</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_NYSML&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1976 NYSML (page does not exist)\">1976 NYSML</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_NYSML&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1977 NYSML (page does not exist)\">1977 NYSML</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_NYSML&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1978 NYSML (page does not exist)\">1978 NYSML</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_NYSML&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1979 NYSML (page does not exist)\">1979 NYSML</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_NYSML&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1980 NYSML (page does not exist)\">1980 NYSML</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_NYSML&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1981 NYSML (page does not exist)\">1981 NYSML</